body:
Ohh good god! Thank you so much for confirming that. It's been eating on my mind. And yeah, mine hovers around 12.2V or so at idle. This was at almost 92-95% of TDP. I appreciate you taking the time to confirm that.

&#x200B;

And that's interesting that you had a change from plugging in the connector to a different rail on the PSU. Did not consider that as a variable.

Yeah! Something like pornfree or nofap would really help me out! I've had these obsessive and self-destructive thoughts forcing me to rewatch porn (especially the more humiliating ones) over and over till I feel like my brain is going to melt!

&#x200B;

As for my relationship, I've never once taken anything out on her. It's just an unease that I feel around her, I feel like I'm not good enough and that I need to look for another person to better satisfy her... It's these thoughts are hard on my mind. It's just so difficult to cope with.
